type `Test` (of `Maybe<Test>` inferred return type) changes to `Maybe` (so it will be inferred as `Maybe<Maybe>`) in `TypeExpander::expandNamedObject` on line 672 in the following chunk of code:

```php
elseif ($return_type->was_static && is_string($static_class_type) && $final) {
    $return_type->value = $static_class_type;
    $return_type->was_static = false;
}
```

here `$return_type->value` was `Test`, now it changes to `Maybe`. `$static_class_type` was `Maybe`.
